  "description": "Allura Signature is a modern elegant handwritten script font designed to bring luxury, sophistication, and natural beauty into your creative projects. Featuring smooth flowing strokes, graceful curves, and authentic signature-style details, this font delivers a refined handwritten appearance with a clean contemporary finish.\nCarefully crafted for premium branding and stylish typography, Allura Signature combines elegant letterforms with excellent readability, making it perfect for both large headlines and delicate text compositions. Ideal for logos, wedding invitations, branding, packaging, social media templates, fashion editorials, beauty products, quotes, photography overlays, business cards, luxury branding, and elegant display typography.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Allura Signature is a modern elegant handwritten script font designed to bring luxury, sophistication, and natural beauty into your creative projects. Featuring smooth flowing strokes, graceful curves, and authentic signature-style details, this font delivers a refined handwritten appearance with a clean contemporary finish.</p>\n<p>Carefully crafted for premium branding and stylish typography, Allura Signature combines elegant letterforms with excellent readability, making it perfect for both large headlines and delicate text compositions. Ideal for logos, wedding invitations, branding, packaging, social media templates, fashion editorials, beauty products, quotes, photography overlays, business cards, luxury branding, and elegant display typography.</p>",
